        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Warp of linen; weft of wool; a scene of the Nativity with Christ, the Child, in the center flanked by two standing figures; a winged creature is above Christ; the figures are woven with, yellow, brown and green on a red ground; framed by a border enclosing a scrolled branch with animal heads on both sides; parts of the left side are torn; 11 threads to 1 centimeter."@en ;
